{% doc %}
  @prompt
    SECTION REQUIREMENTS
    1. DESKTOP LAYOUT
    
    Two columns in one row using flexbox
    
    Left side: text content
    
    Right side: Wistia video embed
    
    Gap between columns (adjustable setting)
    
    Ability to reverse layout (video left, content right)
    
    2. MOBILE LAYOUT
    
    Stack layout: content first, video second
    
    Full width
    
    Responsive and clean
    
    Remove all unnecessary white overlay buttons above the video
    
    Ensure video is touch-friendly
    
    CONTENT SETTINGS (LEFT SIDE)
    
    Add editable fields:
    
    Heading (rich text)
    
    Subheading (text)
    
    Description (rich text)
    
    Bullet points (list)
    
    Text alignment option: left / center
    
    Content width control (slider: 40%–60%)
    
    Option to hide/show bullet points
    
    Button text + button link (optional)
    
    VIDEO SETTINGS (RIGHT SIDE)
    
    Add editable fields:
    
    Wistia embed code (textarea)
    
    Option to choose image instead of video
    
    Image picker (if image mode selected)
    
    Video border radius
    
    Video autoplay toggle
    
    Video mute toggle
    
    Enable/disable video controls
    
    Responsive scaling (16:9 container)
    
    LAYOUT & STYLING SETTINGS
    
    Add section-level options:
    
    Background color picker
    
    Padding top & bottom
    
    Column gap (slider)
    
    Border radius for image/video
    
    Enable full-width or container-width mode
    
    Reverse layout toggle
    
    Desktop should switch columns
    
    Mobile always stacks content first then video
    
    BEHAVIOR REQUIREMENTS
    
    Wistia embed must scale responsively using an aspect-ratio wrapper
    
    No autoplay unless merchant enables it
    
    Autoplay must always start muted
    
    Make the video responsive and remove any default overlay buttons from Wistia
    
    Add clean CSS using BEM naming
    
    Ensure no global styles interfere
    
    CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Use semantic HTML (h2, p, ul/li)
    
    Use Shopify section schema
    
    Wrap video in a responsive .aspect-video container
    
    Use flex-direction: row-reverse when “Reverse Layout” toggle is ON
    
    Mobile breakpoint at 768px
    
    EXPECTED OUTPUT
    
    Generate:
    
    Full Liquid section
    
    Complete HTML structure
    
    Responsive CSS
    
    JavaScript only if needed (for autoplay/mute controls)
    
